# Build & deployment (MyWallet)

Workspace / nginx root: `/home/nvnhan0810/www/wallets.nvnhan0810.com`  
Dev host: `https://wallets-dev.nvnhan0810.com` (nginx :9080 + Cloudflare)  
PHP: `php8.5-fpm` socket `/run/php/php8.5-fpm.sock`

**Dev is local nginx + PHP-FPM, not K3s.** Edits under this tree are served live after build/reload.

When changing CSS/JS/TS or Blade:

1. **Build FE:** `npm run build` in the workspace root
2. **PHP-FPM / OPcache:** if Blade/PHP views look stale, reload FPM:
   - `sudo systemctl reload php8.5-fpm`
3. **Verify:** `curl -s https://wallets-dev.nvnhan0810.com/login | grep ...`

PHPUnit uses PostgreSQL database `wallets_testing` (see `phpunit.xml`); do not run `RefreshDatabase` against `nvnhan0810_wallets_dev`.
